Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.10,0:00:03.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(忆往昔)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.92,0:00:07.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.69,0:00:08.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,莉莎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lisa.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.42,0:00:10.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道我为什么从不提起我的工作吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know how I never mentioned my job?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.40,0:00:11.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这就是我的工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is my job.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.21,0:00:14.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果不是你  本早就没命了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ben wouldn't be alive if it wasn't for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.29,0:00:15.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你可以留下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're welcome to stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.60,0:00:16.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.81,0:00:17.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这不是我的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.64,0:00:21.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有个人的力量远强于米迦勒\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is someone besides Michael 
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.75,0:00:23.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他能够对付路西法\N{\fnArial\fs30}strong enough to take Lucifer.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.15,0:00:24.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-是谁  - 上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who's that? - God.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.38,0:00:26.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要找出上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna find god.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.48,0:00:27.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是约书亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Joshua.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.36,0:00:28.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你  能和上帝对话\N{\fnArial\fs30}You...talk to god?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.59,0:00:31.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他知道天启被开启了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He knows that the apocalypse has begun.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.37,0:00:33.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只不过他认为这跟他没什么关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}He just doesn't think it's his problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.87,0:00:35.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-跟他没关系  - 他职责已尽\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No his problem? - He's finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.84,0:00:38.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又一个满嘴借口不负责任的老头  是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just another deadbeat dad with a bunch of excuses, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.87,0:00:40.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可能约书亚在说谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe Joshua was lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.62,0:00:41.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得他没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think he was.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.99,0:00:43.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你个混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}You son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.01,0:00:45.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我曾坚信\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believed in...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.12,0:00:47.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们可以找到别的方法\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll find another way.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.98,0:00:49.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们仍可以阻止这一切  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can still stop all this, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.81,0:00:50.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么阻止\N{\fnArial\fs30}How?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.85,0:00:52.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.03,0:00:53.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我们会找到办法的  你和我\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we'll find it. You and me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.66,0:00:55.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们会找到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.86,0:00:58.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(如今)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.19,0:01:10.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-再开快点  迪恩  - 已经是极限了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Drive faster, Dean. - I can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.36,0:01:12.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.12,0:01:13.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然  好得不得了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I'm amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.76,0:01:15.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你以前有见过这么多吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ever seen that many?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.00,0:01:17.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没  至少一个地方不会有这么多\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No way. Not in one place.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.06,0:01:18.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到底怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.92,0:01:32.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.57,0:02:05.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.64,0:02:22.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这情形可不多见啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's something you don't see every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.33,0:02:28.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们俩没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You two all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.29,0:02:35.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好得很\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peachy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.11,0:02:37.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,留神点儿  这  这儿可是处处危机四伏啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be careful. It's...Dangerous around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.94,0:02:39.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等  等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa, whoa, whoa. Wait, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.71,0:02:40.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不用道谢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No need to thank us.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.89,0:02:43.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是  稍微等一下  你们是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, hold up a sec! Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.27,0:02:45.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们是受路德教会洗礼过的自卫队\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're the sacrament Lutheran militia.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.21,0:02:46.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉  是什么来着\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry -- the what?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.99,0:02:48.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也不想告诉你们这些  但那些全是恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hate to tell you this, but those were demons,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.79,0:02:51.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而这一切都源于天启\N{\fnArial\fs30}and this is the apocalypse.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.00,0:02:53.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以  小心点吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So...Buckle up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.32,0:03:13.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,显然我们都是干同一行的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like we're in the same line of business.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.04,0:03:15.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错  都是同行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, and among colleagues.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.06,0:03:17.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是警用散弹枪吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a police-issue shotgun.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.95,0:03:19.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而那个卡车则是\N{\fnArial\fs30}That truck is, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.45,0:03:20.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是太有才了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Inspired.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.70,0:03:22.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些玩意儿你们都是从哪儿搞来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where'd you guys pick up all this crap?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.77,0:03:25.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些都是日积月累  水到渠成的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, you...Pick things up along the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.71,0:03:28.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,得了  伙计们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.59,0:03:30.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,整个国家都充斥着恶魔出现的征兆\N{\fnArial\fs30}This whole corner of the state is nuts with demon omens.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.86,0:03:32.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们只不过想略尽绵力  仅此而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}We just want to help. That's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.39,0:03:34.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们都是同一阵线的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're on the same team here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.69,0:03:36.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟我们但说无妨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just talk to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.95,0:03:43.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟我们来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Follow us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.66,0:04:12.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪伦  这是教堂  把耳机摘了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dylan, it's a church. Headphones off.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.47,0:04:14.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,遵命  老妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.28,0:04:28.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没想到在天启之际还能有如此浪漫之事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who would have thought the apocalypse could be so romantic?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.35,0:04:35.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,缔结连理  成立家庭  这是主的恩赐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marriage, family -- it's a blessing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.16,0:04:39.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尤其是在当下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Especially in times lik this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.30,0:04:41.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以好好珍惜\N{\fnArial\fs30}So hold on to that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.93,0:04:44.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,婚礼啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wedding?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.40,0:04:46.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没开玩笑吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.61,0:04:47.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.57,0:04:50.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到目前为止  这周已有8对新人完婚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've had eight so far this week.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.23,0:05:02.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,罗布说你俩是猎杀恶魔的\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, Rob tells me you boys hunt demons.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.44,0:05:05.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的  神父\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh...Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.32,0:05:11.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你们错过很多\N{\fnArial\fs30}You missed a few.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.66,0:05:13.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错  谁说不是呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, tell us about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.41,0:05:15.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道为什么恶魔都聚在这儿吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any idea why they're here?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.40,0:05:17.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它们肯定是喜欢我们吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}They sure seem to like us, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.04,0:05:20.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟我来  先生们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Follow me, gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.07,0:05:25.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么说  你是个传教士\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you're a preacher.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.38,0:05:27.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,出乎你的意料吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not what you expected, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.15,0:05:28.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伙计  你可带着枪呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, Dude, you're packing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.96,0:05:31.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,非常时期嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Strange times.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.09,0:05:40.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,制盐弹的是个12岁的孩子吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that a 12-year-old packing salt rounds?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.30,0:05:41.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,每个人都加入进来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody pitches in.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.77,0:05:43.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,整个教会吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, the whole church?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.44,0:05:45.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是整个镇\N{\fnArial\fs30}The whole town.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.30,0:05:46.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,整个镇全是猎魔人\N{\fnArial\fs30}A whole town full of hunters?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.63,0:05:48.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真不知道该尖叫而逃还是该留下安居\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know whether to run screaming or buy a condo.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.78,0:05:51.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,与其被恶魔追杀  还不如奋起反抗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, the demons were killing us. We had to do something.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.07,0:05:52.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么不向其他猎魔人求助呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}So why not call the naional guard?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.89,0:05:55.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-有人叫我们别去  - 谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We were told not to. - By who?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.12,0:05:57.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,行了  神父\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Padre.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.87,0:05:59.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,您都全副武装了还矜持啥\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're as locked and loaded as we've ever seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.68,0:06:01.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那些驱魔咒都是以诺语\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that exorcism was Enochian.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.07,0:06:02.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一定有人教过你什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone's telling you something.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.87,0:06:06.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很抱歉  我  我不能透露\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I'm sorry. I, uh, I can't discuss it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.66,0:06:09.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-爸爸  没关系  - 莉亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dad, it's okay. - Leah --
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.20,0:06:12.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们是温切斯特家的萨姆和迪恩  是自己人\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Sam and Dean Winchester. They're safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.06,0:06:16.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我对他们了若指掌\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know all about them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.36,0:06:17.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.92,0:06:19.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.14,0:06:20.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从天使那儿了解的\N{\fnArial\fs30}From the angels.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.19,0:06:22.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天使那儿  棒极了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The angels. Awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.88,0:06:24.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别担心  他们不知道你们在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry. They can't see you here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.82,0:06:27.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们肋骨上不是刻有咒文吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}The...Marks on your ribs, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.52,0:06:33.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么  我们的事都是天使告诉你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you know all about us because angels told you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.14,0:06:35.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错  当然还有其他事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. Among other things.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.38,0:06:37.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比如那利落的驱魔法术\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like the snappy little exorcism spell.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.34,0:06:39.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且他们还会告诉我恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they show me where the demons are gonna be
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.06,0:06:41.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,将在哪里现身  我们该如何反击\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before it happens, how to fight back.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.39,0:06:44.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她从没出过错  一次也没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's never been wrong. Not once.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.30,0:06:45.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-她很特别  - 老爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}- She's very special. - Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.91,0:06:49.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我猜猜  在你看见预兆之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me guess -- before you see something,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.19,0:06:53.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你头会很痛  还能看见闪光\N{\fnArial\fs30}You get a really bad migraine, you see flashing lights?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.11,0:06:54.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How'd you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.43,0:06:56.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你可不是我们遇到的第一个先知\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause you're not the first prophet we've met.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.49,0:06:58.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但你是最迷人的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you are the cutest.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.33,0:07:04.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别误会  我这话完全是出于敬意\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean that with total respect, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.95,0:07:08.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是语音信箱  请留言给\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've reached the voicemail box of...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.89,0:07:12.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不明白  干嘛要让我说自己的名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't understand. Why do I have to say my name?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.79,0:07:18.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡西  是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass. Hey. Uh, it's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.75,0:07:21.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们在明尼苏达的布卢厄斯县\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, we are in blue earth, Minnesota,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.35,0:07:23.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们怕是需要你帮忙了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, um, we could use a little help.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.46,0:07:25.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但愿你能收到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I...Hope you get this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.98,0:07:29.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今晚很忙啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Busy night.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.99,0:07:31.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,甭提了  自从末日开启\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm telling you, since the end started,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.28,0:07:33.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里就没歇过\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's been like one long last call.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.32,0:07:36.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-这杯算我的  - 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That round's on me. - Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.01,0:07:44.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,联系上卡西没\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, did you get ahold of cass?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.07,0:07:47.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的  我给他留了言了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I left him a message. I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.66,0:07:49.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么看\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, uh, what's your theory?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.57,0:07:51.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么所有恶魔都出动了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why all the demon hits?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.79,0:07:53.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.38,0:07:57.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或许是来围杀这先知小姑娘的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gank the girl prophet, maybe?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.71,0:08:02.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-怎么  - 天使们让这些人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What?  - Just, these angels are sending these people
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.26,0:08:04.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来做他们的脏活\N{\fnArial\fs30}To do their dirty work.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.24,0:08:06.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  那又如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. And?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.00,0:08:10.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们都可能死无葬身之地\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they could get ripped to shreds.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.28,0:08:15.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们都会死  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're all gonna die, sam,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.80,0:08:18.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一个月  或者两个月\N{\fnArial\fs30}In like a month -- maybe two.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.10,0:08:19.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是认真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.78,0:08:22.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是世界末日啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, this is the end of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.72,0:08:25.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是这些人没有害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}But these people aren't freaking out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.00,0:08:28.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,事实上  他们在井然有序的奔向终点\N{\fnArial\fs30}In fact, they're running to the exits in an orderly fashion.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.77,0:08:31.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道那算不算是一件坏事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know that that's such a bad thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.49,0:08:34.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁说他们都会死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who says they're all gonna die?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.35,0:08:37.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那要是我们拯救了他们呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever happened to us saving them?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.52,0:08:50.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如我所言\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something I said?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.26,0:08:53.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,保罗  怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Paul, what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.15,0:08:55.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,莉亚又看到了神示\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leah's had another vision.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.39,0:09:01.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要去教堂一趟吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Want to go to church?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.38,0:09:04.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你了解我的  绝对虔诚的信徒\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know me -- downright pious.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.16,0:09:08.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,距塔尔梅奇路3英里处\N{\fnArial\fs30}3 miles off Talmadge Road.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.38,0:09:11.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是5英里\N{\fnArial\fs30}5 miles.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.96,0:09:13.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有恶魔聚集\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are demons gathered.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.27,0:09:15.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道有多少个  但有很多\N{\fnArial\fs30}I...Don't know how many, but a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.52,0:09:17.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢  莉亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Leah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.27,0:09:19.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么  谁和我一起去\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, who's gonna join me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.02,0:09:21.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到哪都别少了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wouldn't miss it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.97,0:09:25.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总得有人罩着罗布\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone's got to cover Rob's ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.17,0:09:27.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,算上我们  神父\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're in, padre.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.51,0:09:29.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.71,0:09:32.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我们来祷告\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd like to offer a prayer.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.19,0:09:36.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们在天上的父\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our father in heaven...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.74,0:09:38.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他可没个父亲样儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, not so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.03,0:09:41.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请在我们为你而战时帮助我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}...Please help us in this fight for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.16,0:09:44.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们祈求您保护我们不受邪恶之徒伤害\N{\fnArial\fs30}We ask you to protect us form all servants of evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.94,0:09:47.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,指引我们将其击溃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guide our hands to defeating them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.02,0:09:50.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我们平安归来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Deliver us home safely.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.37,0:09:52.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,感激不尽  阿门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you. Amen.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.48,0:11:47.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想这就是那感觉吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess that's what it's like, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.45,0:11:49.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.21,0:11:50.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有援兵啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Having backup.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.26,0:11:54.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean! Sam!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.23,0:11:58.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, um, is -- is that --
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.44,0:12:01.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可以搭你们的车回去吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that cool if I get a ride back with you guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.32,0:12:05.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你都救了我两次了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you saved my ass twice already.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.82,0:12:07.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再多一次你就可以开我的车了\N{\fnArial\fs30}One more time, you can drive.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.61,0:12:08.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要啤酒吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get a beer?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.79,0:12:17.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你应得的  别跟你妈说\N{\fnArial\fs30}You earned it. Don't tell your mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.30,0:12:19.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,相信我  我不会说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, believe me -- I will not.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.18,0:12:49.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.78,0:13:11.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,夫人  我们非常抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ma'am, we're just, um, very sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.71,0:13:12.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.90,0:13:15.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这都怪你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is your fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.42,0:13:16.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,简\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jane.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.16,0:13:36.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我希望自己知道该说点什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish I knew what to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.06,0:13:39.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.14,0:13:43.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我真的很抱歉  简\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so sorry, Jane.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.93,0:13:46.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,罗布\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rob.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.86,0:13:49.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有预言提到此事\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are no words
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.54,0:13:51.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dylan...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.80,0:13:54.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道这为何会发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know why this happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.46,0:13:58.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道这一切都为何会发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know why any of this is happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.71,0:14:02.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无从解答\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got no easy answers.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.97,0:14:06.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我所知的只是\N{\fnArial\fs30}But what I do know is --
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.08,0:14:07.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,莉亚  莉亚  宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leah? Leah, honey?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.74,0:14:10.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,莉亚  宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leah, honey?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.81,0:14:12.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honey?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.33,0:14:14.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没事的  亲爱的  没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay, sweetie. It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.67,0:14:21.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爸爸  是迪伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad, it's Dylan.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.03,0:14:21.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去休息一会吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just rest a minute, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.94,0:14:24.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.14,0:14:26.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪伦会回来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dylan's coming back.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.08,0:14:34.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,简  罗布\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jane, Rob...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.49,0:14:36.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一切都会没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's going to be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.11,0:14:38.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们会再见到迪伦的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll see Dylan gain.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.38,0:14:42.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当末日  也就是审判日到来时\N{\fnArial\fs30}When the final day comes, judgment day,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.26,0:14:45.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他会复活的  你们终将团聚\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll be resurrected, and you'll be together again.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.10,0:14:48.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们都将团聚  和我们所爱的人一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll all be together -- with all our loved ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.80,0:14:50.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们是被选中的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've been chosen.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.84,0:14:52.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天使选择了我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}The angels have chosen us.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.70,0:14:55.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们将被赐予人间天堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we will be given paradise on earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.77,0:15:00.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们需要做的只是遵从天使的诫律\N{\fnArial\fs30}All we have to do is follow the angels' commandments.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.17,0:15:09.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戒饮酒  戒赌博  戒婚前性行为\N{\fnArial\fs30}No drinking, no gambling, no premarital sex?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.40,0:15:10.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  基本上这些和你性格的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, they basically just outlawed
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.85,0:15:12.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,90%都格格不入\N{\fnArial\fs30}90% of your personality.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.23,0:15:14.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  没办法  入乡随俗吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, whatever. When in Rome.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.51,0:15:18.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么说  你居然不介意\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, uh... You're cool with it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.06,0:15:20.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不是不介意  也不是介意\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not cool. I'm not not cool. It's --
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.82,0:15:22.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着  兄弟  我不是先知\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, man, I'm not a prophet.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.09,0:15:23.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不是本地人		\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not locals.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.66,0:15:25.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这不是由我决定的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not my call.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.89,0:15:30.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等会儿再找你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll catch up with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.12,0:15:40.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,进来的不是时候吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}This a bad time?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.22,0:15:44.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,差不多吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}In general.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.10,0:15:46.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在可以了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.37,0:15:53.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天使的事情让你精疲力尽了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Angel stuff really takes it out of you, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.33,0:15:55.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没什么好抱怨的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't complain.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.35,0:15:58.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你经历过更糟糕的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you have it worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.03,0:16:03.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么  迪恩  你是怎么想的  \N{\fnArial\fs30}So...What's on your mind, Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.19,0:16:10.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别误会我的意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't take this the wrong way, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.79,0:16:12.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是你说的是真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you on the level?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.93,0:16:15.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哪部分\N{\fnArial\fs30}About what
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.26,0:16:19.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,关于天堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}About paradise.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.81,0:16:22.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天堂怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.74,0:16:26.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想知道天使们对你说了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to know what the angels are telling you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.56,0:16:28.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所有的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.29,0:16:31.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"充满希望"那部分就不用说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you can skip the rainbows.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.35,0:16:34.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,会有一场激烈的战斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's gonna be a prizefight,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.18,0:16:37.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,会很惨烈\N{\fnArial\fs30}And... It's gonna get bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.30,0:16:41.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在我们取胜之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}But after we win --
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.22,0:16:43.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然我们会赢的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we will --
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.19,0:16:46.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,地球将会托付给被选中的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The planet gets handed over to the chosen,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.05,0:16:49.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最终会充满祥和\N{\fnArial\fs30}And... It's finally peaceful.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.56,0:16:54.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有怪物  没有疾病  没有死亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}No monsters, no disease, no death.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.85,0:16:57.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人们		\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're just...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.47,0:17:00.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和相爱的人在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}With the people you love.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.49,0:17:06.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然  只有当你跨入高级门槛才可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Course, that's if you can get past the velvet rope.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.42,0:17:12.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,被选中肯定很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Must be nice -- being chosen.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.93,0:17:14.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, Dean...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.51,0:17:16.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就是被选中的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're chosen.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.31,0:17:19.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.15,0:17:21.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不如说是被诅咒的\N{\fnArial\fs30}More like cursed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.96,0:17:24.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很辛苦吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Must be hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.70,0:17:29.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,作为天使的皮囊并且不抱希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}Being the vessel of heaven and having no hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.38,0:17:49.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么会这样  不是"天启生意红火"吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what happened to, uh, "The apocalypse is good for business"?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.29,0:17:53.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  直到莉亚的天使朋友们禁止了这好事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah. Right up until Leah's angel pals banned the good stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.61,0:17:54.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,帮我消耗一些库存吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me kill some inventory?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.73,0:17:55.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好呀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.17,0:17:57.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别误会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't get me wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.59,0:17:59.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在这里长大  我爱这个小镇\N{\fnArial\fs30}I grew up here. I love this town.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.66,0:18:01.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.14,0:18:02.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那些虔诚的信徒\N{\fnArial\fs30}well, these holy rollers...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.74,0:18:04.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.06,0:18:07.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我注意到你不是那种会祈祷的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I, uh, I noticed you're not the praying type.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.29,0:18:10.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是咱的秘密  他们有一半都不是信徒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, between you and me, neither are half those guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.45,0:18:12.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,几个月前  他们都还在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Couple of months back, they were all in here,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.02,0:18:14.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,酗酒  滥交\N{\fnArial\fs30}Getting wasted, banging the nanny.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.42,0:18:16.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在他们都成了上帝的战士了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now they're all warriors of god.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.67,0:18:17.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,干杯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cheers.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.57,0:18:18.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,干杯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cheers.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.72,0:18:27.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着  恶魔肯定是存在的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, there're sure as hell demons.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.41,0:18:29.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许的确有上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}And maybe there is a god.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.71,0:18:33.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道  无所谓  但我不是伪君子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. Fine. But I'm not a hypocrite.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.36,0:18:35.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我之前从未祈祷过  现在也不会开始祈祷\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never prayed before, and I ain't starting now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.23,0:18:37.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果我下地狱  也是坦坦荡荡的\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I go to hell, I'm going honest.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.71,0:18:39.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}How 'bout you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.35,0:18:41.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.40,0:18:43.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我猜你也不是一个真正的信徒  对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not a true believer, I take it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.71,0:18:46.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是信徒  是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.89,0:18:47.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.71,0:18:49.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.49,0:18:53.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很确信上帝很久以前就不关心我们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pretty sure god stopped caring a long time ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.92,0:19:02.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你去哪啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where you been?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.39,0:19:04.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喝酒去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drinkin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.56,0:19:06.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这个叛徒\N{\fnArial\fs30}You rebel.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.67,0:19:09.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我本可以再多喝点的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd have had more, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.49,0:19:11.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是有宵禁\N{\fnArial\fs30}...But it was curfew.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.57,0:19:12.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.25,0:19:14.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你听说他们把信号发射塔关了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You hear they shut down the cell towers?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.86,0:19:18.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有  对我而言这是个新闻\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. That's, uh, news to me
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.11,0:19:18.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是呀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.77,0:19:21.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有有线电视和网络\N{\fnArial\fs30}No cable, internet.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.34,0:19:25.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,与"外面腐朽的世界"完全隔离\N{\fnArial\fs30}Total cutoff from the "Corruption of the outside world."
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.20,0:19:29.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还不懂吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you get it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.83,0:19:30.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们在把这个地方变为\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're turning this place
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.85,0:19:33.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,类似于正统基督教聚集的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Into some kind of fundamentalist compound.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.44,0:19:34.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的  我懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.61,0:19:36.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你就只会哼一声\N{\fnArial\fs30}And all you got's a "Hmm"?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.35,0:19:37.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.62,0:19:39.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我懂  我只是不关心\N{\fnArial\fs30}I get it. I just don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.66,0:19:41.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.70,0:19:44.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有什么区别吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What difference does it make?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.05,0:19:45.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,区别大了去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It makes a hell of a --
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.02,0:19:51.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从啥时起这事与你无关了\N{\fnArial\fs30}At what point does this become too far for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.05,0:19:54.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,石箭  毒圣水[指信徒之虔诚]\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stoning? Poisoned kool-aid?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.01,0:19:56.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天使们在耍这些人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The angels are toying with these people.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.50,0:19:57.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天使的世界要守他们的规矩  伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Angel world, angel rules, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.89,0:19:59.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么时候开始你对此无动于衷了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And since when is that okay with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.15,0:20:01.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从天使们成了唯一的希望开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}Since the angels got the only lifeboats on the titanic.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.32,0:20:04.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是说  到底谁应该\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, who exactly is
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.26,0:20:05.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现身去拯救这些人\N{\fnArial\fs30}supposed to come along and save these people?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.74,0:20:07.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,曾经应该是我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was supposed to be us.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.46,0:20:09.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.09,0:20:10.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么  你想\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what, you -- you want to --
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.66,0:20:13.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不再战斗  自暴自弃\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to just stop fighting, roll over?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.67,0:20:15.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道  也许吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.15,0:20:20.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别那样说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.45,0:20:22.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-为什么呢  - 你不能这样 \N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why not?  - 'Cause you can't do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.34,0:20:23.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,实际上  我可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.64,0:20:27.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  你不能  你不能这样对我\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you can't. You can' this to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.95,0:20:34.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我有一股力量支撑着自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got one thing -- one thing keeping me going.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.24,0:20:38.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你以为只有你在挣扎吗  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think you're the only one white-knuckling it here, Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.13,0:20:40.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没法依靠别人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't count on anyone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.93,0:20:43.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也没法一个人完成\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I can't do this alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.69,0:20:50.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.43,0:20:52.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要静一静\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got to clear my head.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.30,0:20:55.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在是宵禁时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's past curfew.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.71,0:20:59.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,已经过宵禁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's past curfew.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.76,0:21:05.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,莉亚  出什么事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leah. What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.40,0:21:07.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爸爸  我能跟你谈谈吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daddy, can I alk to you for a second?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.31,0:21:08.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.43,0:21:12.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,莉亚  亲爱的  怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leah, honey, w-wha is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.75,0:21:15.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起  我很抱歉  他们都很生气\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. I'm sorry. They're just so angry.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.39,0:21:17.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-谁很生气  - 那些天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who's angry?  - The angels.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.13,0:21:19.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们为什么生气呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are they angry?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.20,0:21:20.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们说\N{\fnArial\fs30}They said...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.21,0:21:24.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们说  我们不能去天堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}they said that we can't go to paradise.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.15,0:21:26.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.66,0:21:28.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但他们说的每一件事我们都做了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we're doing everything they say!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.17,0:21:30.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们声称  他们下达了明确的命令\N{\fnArial\fs30}They said they gave clear commandments,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.05,0:21:31.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是我们之中有人没有服从\N{\fnArial\fs30}but some people aren't listening.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.83,0:21:34.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是谁  莉亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who, Leah?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.52,0:21:50.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我收到了你的留言\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got your message.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.54,0:21:55.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的留言  真长\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was long, your message.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.03,0:21:58.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的声音听起来有些刺耳\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I find the sound of your voice grating.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.31,0:22:01.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.89,0:22:03.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.05,0:22:05.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喝高了\N{\fnArial\fs30}drunk?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.15,0:22:07.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.93,0:22:12.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.16,0:22:15.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你到底怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell hppened to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.55,0:22:17.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我找到一家酒品店\N{\fnArial\fs30}I found a liquor store.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.33,0:22:17.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.97,0:22:19.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后我喝了个痛快\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I drank it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.72,0:22:21.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你找我干嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why'd you call me?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.07,0:22:23.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哇  稳住  小心点\N{\fnArial\fs30}whoa. There you go. Easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.19,0:22:25.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.17,0:22:32.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别问这么蠢的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't ask stupid questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.03,0:22:35.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,找我到底什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me what you need.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.73,0:22:38.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里一直频繁遭到恶魔袭击\N{\fnArial\fs30}T-there have been these -- these demon attacks,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.10,0:22:39.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就在镇子周围\N{\fnArial\fs30}massive, right on the edge of town,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.63,0:22:40.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们搞不懂为什么他们...\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we can't figure out why they're --
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.87,0:22:42.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有天使出现的迹象吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any sign of angels?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.28,0:22:43.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,算是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sort of.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.04,0:22:45.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们一直在和这个先知交流\N{\fnArial\fs30}They've been speaking to this prophet.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.21,0:22:45.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哪个先知\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.96,0:22:47.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是个女孩  叫莉亚·吉迪恩 \N{\fnArial\fs30}This girl, Leah Gideon.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.97,0:22:48.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她不是先知\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's not a prophet.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.86,0:22:49.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我很确定她是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm pretty sure she is.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.95,0:22:52.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,幻象  头疼  该有的征兆她都有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Visions, headaches -- the whole package.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.66,0:22:55.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所有先知的名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}The names of all the prophets --
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.68,0:22:58.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都深深刻在我脑子里\N{\fnArial\fs30}they're seared into my brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.38,0:23:01.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,莉亚·吉迪恩不是其中之一\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leah Gideon is not one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.75,0:23:04.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那她是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then what is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.22,0:23:15.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我告诉过你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.92,0:23:19.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家都镇静\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please guys guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.98,0:23:21.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不需要再跟你说第二遍\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't need to tell you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.94,0:23:23.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们俩  都别激动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take a breath, both of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.49,0:23:25.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们跑到我的地盘  出言不逊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You come on my property, spouting some kind of crazy --
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.02,0:23:26.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉保罗  我们别无选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, Paul! There's no other way!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.97,0:23:28.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜托  这是个什么地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on! What country is this, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.56,0:23:31.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,神父  要帮忙吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Need a hand, Padre?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.57,0:23:33.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家都先冷静一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just, everybody cool down for a minute!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.48,0:23:34.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,冷静是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Cool down," Eh? 
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.05,0:23:35.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我兄弟想把我扫地出门  赶出这个镇\N{\fnArial\fs30}My friends are trying to run me out of town.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.55,0:23:36.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得我该冷静吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you think I should cool down?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.63,0:23:38.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,保罗我很抱歉  这不是我们能决定的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, Paul. It is not our choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.57,0:23:39.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜托  别扯淡了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, come on. That's bull.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.64,0:23:41.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了大家  你必须走\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got to go -- for everyone's sake!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.38,0:23:42.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们从小一起长大\N{\fnArial\fs30}We grew up together.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.58,0:23:43.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我出席了你的婚礼\N{\fnArial\fs30}I stood up at your wedding!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.92,0:23:45.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  确实  不过那是过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, you did, but that was then.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.54,0:23:47.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而现在  你站在民众的对立面了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now you're standing against the flock.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.29,0:23:48.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这不是事实  我和你们并肩战斗的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not true. I fight with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.61,0:23:50.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,保罗  这个镇子的人都是信徒\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a town of believers, Paul.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.04,0:23:52.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而你不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are not a believer.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.15,0:23:54.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别让我们为难了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't make this hard for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.25,0:23:57.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让你为难\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hard for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.42,0:24:02.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.35,0:24:04.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是我的家\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is my home.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.85,0:24:06.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们想让我走人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want me out of here?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.29,0:24:08.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就得先放倒我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll have to drag me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.00,0:24:12.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  你可不想这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa, whoa, whoa. You don't want to do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.68,0:24:13.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,滚开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out of my --
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.62,0:24:18.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别  停手\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.11,0:24:24.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁都不能阻止我再见到我儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one's gonna stop me from seeing my son again.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.00,0:24:44.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们到处找你\N{\fnArial\fs30}We went out looking for --
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.95,0:24:47.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.58,0:24:53.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没事  这不是我的血\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. It's -- it's not my blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.12,0:24:54.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,保罗死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Paul's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.43,0:24:55.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啥\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.30,0:24:56.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,简一枪嘣了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jane shot him.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.27,0:24:58.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,开始了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's starting.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.28,0:24:58.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么开始了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's starting?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.98,0:25:00.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你他妹的跑哪去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where the hell have you been?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.60,0:25:02.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,寻欢作乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}On a bender.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.26,0:25:03.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他  你刚是说寻欢作乐吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did he -- did you say "On a bender"?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.87,0:25:05.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  他现在还没缓过来呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. He's still pretty smashed.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.60,0:25:08.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个不重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is not of import.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.42,0:25:11.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们得谈谈这里发生的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to talk about what's happening here.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.14,0:25:12.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,洗耳恭听\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm all ears.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.40,0:25:14.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  首先\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, for starters...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.84,0:25:16.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,莉亚不是先知\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leah is not a real prophet.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.21,0:25:19.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那她到底是啥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, what is she, exactly?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.42,0:25:20.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,淫妇\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Whore.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.95,0:25:23.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡西  说说你到底是怎么想的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow. Cass, tell us what you really think.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.34,0:25:26.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,路西法再临人间的时候  她也复活了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She rises when Lucifer walks the earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.22,0:25:29.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"她将降临  传播错误的预言"\N{\fnArial\fs30}"And she shall come, bearing false prophecy."
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.86,0:25:34.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这东西能化作人形\N{\fnArial\fs30}This creature has power to take a human's form,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.68,0:25:35.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还会读心术\N{\fnArial\fs30}read minds.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.69,0:25:38.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,启示录称她为  巴比伦淫妇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Book of Revelation calls her "The Whore of Babylon."
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.59,0:25:39.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,够醒目的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's catchy.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.60,0:25:41.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真正的莉亚可能好几个月前就被杀了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The real Leah was probably killed months ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.68,0:25:43.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那恶魔袭击镇子怎么解释呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about the demons attacking the town?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.40,0:25:44.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它们都听她指挥\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're under her control.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.65,0:25:46.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那些驱魔咒呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the Enochian exorcism?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.03,0:25:46.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,假的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fake.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.62,0:25:48.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它们真正的意思是\N{\fnArial\fs30}It actually means
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.87,0:25:51.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"你个山羊嘴里吐出来的"\N{\fnArial\fs30}"You, um, breed with the mouth of a goat."
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.86,0:25:59.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还是用以诺语说比较好玩\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's funnier in Enochian.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.67,0:26:01.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那些恶魔化烟而飞  其实都是假的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So the demons smoking out -- that's just a con?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.25,0:26:03.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么  它们有什么目的啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why? What's the endgame?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.91,0:26:04.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你刚刚亲眼所见的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you just saw --
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.20,0:26:06.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以上帝的名义让无辜百姓鲜血四溅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Innocent bloods spilled in god's name.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.97,0:26:08.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那些所谓神谕你都听见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You all heard that heaven talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.31,0:26:09.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她操纵利用人们\N{\fnArial\fs30}She manipulates people.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.17,0:26:13.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让人们一边唱着赞美诗一边肆意杀戮\N{\fnArial\fs30}To slaughter and kill and sing peppy little hymns.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.77,0:26:15.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太厉害了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.12,0:26:19.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她的目的就是尽量把人们的灵魂送往地狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her goal is to condemn as many souls to hell as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.73,0:26:21.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这才只是刚开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it's...Just beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.25,0:26:23.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,用不了多久\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's well on her way
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.40,0:26:25.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她就能让整个镇子都万劫不复了\N{\fnArial\fs30}to dragging this whole town into the pit.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.91,0:26:26.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.21,0:26:30.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们要怎么解决那个来自巴比伦的\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, then, how do we go pimp of Babylon
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.61,0:26:31.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拉皮条的贱人\N{\fnArial\fs30}all over this bitch?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.53,0:26:35.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是想...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I only wanted to --
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.56,0:26:38.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我把事情变得更糟了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did I make it worse?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.59,0:26:41.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我惹怒了天使们吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did I make the angels angry?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.17,0:26:42.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,简\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jane.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.25,0:26:45.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天使们  他们理解的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The angels -- they understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.83,0:26:47.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你所做的是为了大局着想\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you did is for the greater good.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.27,0:26:49.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊 \N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.43,0:26:51.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太好了 \N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.27,0:26:53.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们都喜欢保罗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We all liked Paul.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.79,0:26:56.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但他是个罪人\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he was a sinner,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.43,0:26:58.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他会连累我们同他一起下地狱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}and he would have taken us down with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.37,0:27:01.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你拯救了我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You saved us.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.02,0:27:01.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.78,0:27:04.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这怎么可能没事呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}How can that be okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.15,0:27:06.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她杀了保罗\N{\fnArial\fs30}She killed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.76,0:27:08.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这项罪孽可远大于...\N{\fnArial\fs30}That sin is so much greater--
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.11,0:27:09.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,打败邪恶之人可不是罪孽\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not a sin to strike down evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.70,0:27:10.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是那些天使怎么会\N{\fnArial\fs30}But how can the angels --
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.78,0:27:13.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你总是教导我要怀有信仰\N{\fnArial\fs30}You always taught me that we have to have faith.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.34,0:27:18.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,用这个可以杀了淫妇\N{\fnArial\fs30}The whore can be killed with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.39,0:27:23.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是由生长在巴比伦的柏树制成的树桩\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a stake made from a cypress tree in babylon.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.20,0:27:26.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很好  我们去消灭她吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great. Let's ventilate her.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.53,0:27:27.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可没那么简单\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not that easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.62,0:27:29.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.69,0:27:32.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只有真正的天主之仆才能杀死淫妇\N{\fnArial\fs30}The whore can only be killed by a true servant of heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.80,0:27:34.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-仆人  就像...  - 你不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Servant, like... - Not you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.30,0:27:35.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.59,0:27:37.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然  主肯定是恨死萨姆了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, of course, is an abomination.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.21,0:27:39.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们必须找别人来干这事\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll have to find someone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.62,0:27:42.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天使们\N{\fnArial\fs30}The angels...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.04,0:27:45.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也不清楚他们为什么选中了我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know why they've chosen us.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.07,0:27:46.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过事实如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}But they have.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.56,0:27:48.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天\N{\fnArial\fs30}And today...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.18,0:27:51.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就在今天  他们告知了我最重要的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Today, they told me the most important thing yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.49,0:27:53.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今晚子夜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tonight, at midnight...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.47,0:28:00.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.25,0:28:03.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是  我们都清楚这天总会到来\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just that we knew this day would come,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.79,0:28:05.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在它就要实现了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and it's here --
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.48,0:28:08.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最后的审判\N{\fnArial\fs30}The final judgment.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.49,0:28:12.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在  我们要立刻行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, we need to do this right.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.01,0:28:13.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有多少时间了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't have much time.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.86,0:28:15.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天使们认为我们还没做好准备\N{\fnArial\fs30}The angels said we're not ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.39,0:28:18.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有一些事情需要我们去解决\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are still a few elements that need to be taken care of.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.98,0:28:21.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,罪人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sinners.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.20,0:28:33.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了  大家都冷静下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, uh, now, everybody calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.81,0:28:34.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,先等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.10,0:28:37.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,莉亚  你吓到大家了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leah, you're scaring these people.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.37,0:28:40.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我并不是要让大家恐慌  但我们必须抓紧了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, I don't want us to panic, but we have to hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.12,0:28:40.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,停下来  \N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.88,0:28:42.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我已经接到了指令和名单\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been given instructions, names.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.79,0:28:43.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.64,0:28:46.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你到底在干什么啊  快停下\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing? Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.38,0:28:47.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这样会害死人的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna get somebody killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.54,0:28:48.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放开我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me go.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.60,0:28:51.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,否则下一个被我指出的罪人就会是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or the next sinner I name will be you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.20,0:29:22.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是戴维·吉迪恩牧师\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pastor David Gideon?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.52,0:29:24.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  你是哪位\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.57,0:29:27.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是天主的使臣\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm an angel of the lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.67,0:29:28.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是嘛  天使啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.99,0:29:37.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这算哪门子事儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.62,0:29:39.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他的确是个天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, he wasn't lying about the angel thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.12,0:29:41.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请坐吧  神父  我们需要谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have a seat, padre. We got to have a chat.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.40,0:29:47.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.60,0:29:49.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她可是我的女儿啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's my daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.63,0:29:51.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很抱歉  但她不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, but she's not.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.09,0:29:52.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是她杀了你的女儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's the thing that killed your daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.80,0:29:53.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这不可能的啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.84,0:29:54.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,千真万确\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.72,0:29:56.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你心里也很清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}And deep down, you know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.73,0:29:59.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们理解  这要求很过分\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, we get it -- it's too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.68,0:30:00.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是如果你选择退缩\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if you don't do this,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.98,0:30:03.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她会害死更多人\N{\fnArial\fs30}she's going to kill a lot of people
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.40,0:30:04.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而剩下的人会下地狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}and damn the rest to hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.81,0:30:05.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是...\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.61,0:30:11.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么单单选我去干这事呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why does it have to be me?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.11,0:30:12.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是天主之仆\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a servant of heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.82,0:30:13.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还是天使呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you're an angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.03,0:30:15.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,并不算是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Poor example of one.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.08,0:30:35.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,注意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heads up.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.86,0:30:41.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我该吃多少\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many should I take?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.23,0:30:42.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.92,0:30:44.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还是把整瓶都吃了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should probably just down the whole bottle.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.26,0:30:48.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.55,0:30:49.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,客气什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, don't mention it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.45,0:30:51.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是过来人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I've been there.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.92,0:30:54.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可是对付不负责任的老爹的专家\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a big expert on deadbeat dads,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.22,0:30:55.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以\N{\fnArial\fs30}So...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.61,0:30:58.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我明白的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.60,0:31:00.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我能体会你的感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know how you feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.89,0:31:06.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是怎么解决的呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you manage it?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.11,0:31:13.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如此美好的一天  斩妖除魔才是王道\N{\fnArial\fs30}On a good day, you get to kill a whore.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.45,0:31:20.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,罗布  简  求求你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rob, Jane, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.97,0:31:22.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,求你们了  是我啊  伊莉斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, it's me! It's Elise!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.93,0:31:23.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry. Really.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.85,0:31:25.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但你明白我们必须那么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you know we have to do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.87,0:31:28.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把他们关到储藏室\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're putting them in the storage unit.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.71,0:31:31.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要  不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.90,0:31:42.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,简  人齐了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jane, is that everyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.40,0:31:45.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.51,0:31:47.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去拿煤油\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get the kerosene.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.07,0:31:54.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.88,0:31:57.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那里面还有孩子呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are kids in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.88,0:32:00.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天使们指名他们一定是有原因的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The angels named them for a reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.21,0:32:04.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,简\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jane...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.46,0:32:07.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你儿子需要你这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your son needs you to do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.21,0:32:38.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爸爸  别伤害我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daddy! Don't hurt me!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.68,0:32:39.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吉迪恩  快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gideon, now!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.10,0:32:49.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吉迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gideon!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.85,0:32:51.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等  别\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.42,0:32:56.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,救命  他是个恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me! He's a demon!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.02,0:33:04.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去点火\N{\fnArial\fs30}Light the kerosene.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.33,0:33:14.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快快\N{\fnArial\fs30}come on come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.65,0:33:34.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,省省吧  你是天主之仆么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please. Like you're a servant of heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.94,0:33:35.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放开我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.80,0:33:38.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我们才会赢\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is why my team's gonna win.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.32,0:33:39.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是那重要的皮囊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the great vessel?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.78,0:33:42.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看你可怜  自我憎恨  还毫无信仰\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're pathetic, self-hating, and faithless.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.58,0:33:44.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,世界末日到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the end of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.42,0:33:48.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你只能袖手旁观  看着一切发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you're just gonna sit back and watch it happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.19,0:33:56.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别说得那么肯定  淫妇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't be so sure, whore.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.46,0:34:31.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我  我不明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I... I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.49,0:34:34.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在我们该怎么去天堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}How are we supposed to get to paradise now?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.53,0:34:37.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.40,0:34:40.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天堂你们肯定是去不成了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pretty sure you're headed in a different direction.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.31,0:34:45.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gotcha.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.43,0:34:48.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来  \N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.73,0:35:02.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  你怎么办到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, how did you do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.15,0:35:03.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.20,0:35:04.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀掉她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill her.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.20,0:35:06.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人品爆发了吧  我猜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Long run of luck held out, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.57,0:35:09.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,据我所知  她只会被\N{\fnArial\fs30}Last I checked, she could only be ganked
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.83,0:35:10.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天主之仆所伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}by a servant of heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.91,0:35:12.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想听我说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, what do you want me to tell you?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.12,0:35:13.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是把握住机会而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw a shot. I went for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.04,0:35:17.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.31,0:35:19.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小心头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch your head, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.76,0:35:24.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是要做什么蠢事么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you gonna do something stupid?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.17,0:35:24.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比如说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like what?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.97,0:35:27.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比如米迦勒版迪恩那种\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like Michael stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.52,0:35:29.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,行了吧萨姆  饶了我吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Sam. Give me a break.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.17,0:35:40.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你头怎么样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's the head?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.83,0:35:41.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看东西双影了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm seeing double.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.43,0:35:43.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许是止疼药的作用\N{\fnArial\fs30}But that may be the painkillers.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.81,0:35:45.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你会没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.95,0:35:47.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.85,0:36:00.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你去哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.32,0:36:04.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去车里找些干净的绷带  别紧张\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just gonna grab some clean bandages out of the trunk.Relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.34,0:36:13.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了  怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK over there. How was that...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.01,0:36:20.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该死的  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it! Dean!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.95,0:37:14.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.43,0:37:17.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗨  莉莎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, Lisa.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.54,0:37:22.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没有你的电话号码  所以\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't have your number, uh, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.51,0:37:24.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不不  没关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No, it's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.10,0:37:26.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我  我只是很惊讶\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm -- I'm...Just surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.17,0:37:30.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,本怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's Ben?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.26,0:37:32.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.04,0:37:34.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很好  他打棒球去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good. He's at baseball.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.32,0:37:36.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.79,0:37:37.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你搬家了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You moved.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.78,0:37:40.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这  房子不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a...nice house.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.90,0:37:42.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  你跑这么远过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, you didn't come all the way here
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.90,0:37:44.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是要说房子什么的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}to talk about real estate.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.85,0:37:46.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.02,0:37:51.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  不太好\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.04,0:37:55.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.01,0:38:03.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着  我没出现幻觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I have no illusions, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.21,0:38:04.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道我的生活是如何的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know the life that I live,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.35,0:38:08.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也知道一切将怎样结束\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know how that's gonna end for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.37,0:38:10.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管怎样  我都无所谓了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever. I'm okay with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.65,0:38:14.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我想让你知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I wanted you to know...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.83,0:38:18.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我脑中浮现的最快乐的时光\N{\fnArial\fs30}...That when I do picture myself happy...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.26,0:38:22.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是和你\N{\fnArial\fs30}...It's with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.53,0:38:25.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有孩子在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.72,0:38:33.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你什么也不用说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, you don't have to say anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.90,0:38:36.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  我是说  我知道我不用说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I... I mean, I know. I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.77,0:38:38.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可我想和你聊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.28,0:38:42.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,进来吧  来喝一杯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come inside. Let me get you a beer.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.00,0:38:43.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也想\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish I could.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.40,0:38:52.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,自己保重  莉莎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take care of yourself, lisa.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.17,0:38:54.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别  等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No, wait, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.33,0:38:57.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不能突然来了吓我一通又马上走\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't just drop a bombshell like that and then leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.75,0:39:00.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.78,0:39:01.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.91,0:39:05.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我别无选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I don't have a choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.31,0:39:07.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  你有  你有的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you do. You do.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.35,0:39:09.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你可以进来让我倒杯酒给你  咱们聊聊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can come inside and let me get you a beer. We can talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.69,0:39:10.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,莉莎  等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lisa, wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.09,0:39:15.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,情况真的会很糟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Things are about to get really bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.85,0:39:17.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,举个例子呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like how?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.11,0:39:21.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-像你这样子吗  - 更糟\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Like your kind of bad? - Worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.59,0:39:24.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,接下来的几天  你会从电视上看到的一些\N{\fnArial\fs30}Next few days, the crap you're gonna see on your tv,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.50,0:39:25.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,相当诡异的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}it' s gonna be downright trippy.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.96,0:39:26.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很可怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.55,0:39:28.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我不想让你担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I don't want you to worry,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.67,0:39:30.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为我会安顿好你和本\N{\fnArial\fs30}because I'm making arrangements for you and ben.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.95,0:39:32.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,安顿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Arrangements?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.75,0:39:34.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管发生什么  你们都不会有事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever happens, you're gonna be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.30,0:39:35.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你什么意思  你说什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean? What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.55,0:39:36.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要去见的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The people that I'm gonna see next,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.80,0:39:37.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,除非他们同意我开出的一些条件\N{\fnArial\fs30}they're not gonna get anything from me
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.97,0:39:39.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,否则别想从我这捞到什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}without agreeing to a few conditions.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.10,0:39:43.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,进来说吧  求你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just...Just come inside. Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.43,0:39:45.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管你打算干什么  别去\N{\fnArial\fs30}And whatever you're thinking of doing, don't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.44,0:39:48.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我必须去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.07,0:39:50.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是陪我一个小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just stay an hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.80,0:39:53.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,至少要和本说再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}At least say bye to Ben.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.31,0:39:59.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还是不说的好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, it's better if I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.71,0:40:18.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再见  莉莎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bye, Lisa.
